            <title><![CDATA[Warhammer 40,000: Speed Freeks DEFFKOPTA Trailer]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/s4sh0fvc/warhammer-40000-speed-freeks-deffkopta-trailer</link>
            <guid>s4sh0fvc</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 23 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[The exciting new Deffkopta blazes through the skies in the latest free update to Warhammer 40,000: Speed Freeks on Steam. As the first flying vehicle to be added to the game, the Deffkopta is speedy, agile and packs a punch with its rokkits, bombs and slicing melee ability.

Head over to the game's Steam page to get a closer look - but not too close, or you might get sliced n diced!]]></description>
