        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Warhammer Age of Sigmar | Wētā Workshop Neave Blacktalon, The God-King's Assassin, 1:6 Scale Statue]]></title>
            <link>https://www.warhammer-community.com/en-gb/videos/s4sh0fvc/warhammer-age-of-sigmar-weta-workshop-neave-blacktalon-the-god-kings-assassin-16-scale-statue</link>
            <guid>s4sh0fvc</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 23 Oct 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Every detail tells the story of Sigmar’s chosen assassin: the splintered war platform beneath her feet, the Orruk helm crushed into the dirt, the storm-forged fury carved into every line of her form.

This dynamic pose was brought to life by our passionate artists, drawing on decades of experience in worldbuilding and character design, distilling Neave’s relentless spirit into collectible form. From the delicate arc of her braided hair in motion, to the painstaking textures of battered iron and bloodied blades, each element has been sculpted, refined, and painted with the same obsessive attention to detail that has come to define our craft.

A hero of the Mortal Realms rendered in full 1:6 scale, Neave Blacktalon, The God-King’s Assassin is a divine example of crafting myth into matter, and fury into form.

Pre-order now: https://wetanz.com/neave-blacktalon]]></description>
            <category domain="videos">Videos</category>
            <category domain="warhammer-age-of-sigmar">Warhammer Age of Sigmar</category>
            <category>videos</category>
            <enclosure url="https://assets.warhammer-community.com/wh_neave_master_v5_17_1920--1080_ytthumbnail-gxq28af0w3.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpg"/>
        </item>
